{"id":"c284ffb568a496fd","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-finite-automaton-language-class.md","title":"Regular Language","display":"df-regular-language — Regular Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","aliases":["73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","73-df-regular-language"],"display":"df-regular-language — Regular Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.2, print pp. 45–55; PDF pp. 67–77; local typed DFA interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.2–2.5 and §3.4, pp. 16–36, 65–71; local language-class notation","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</span><span>73-df-regular-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-language — Regular Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.2, print pp. 45–55; PDF pp. 67–77; local typed DFA interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.2–2.5 and §3.4, pp. 16–36, 65–71; local language-class notation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (DFA class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (language accepted by a DFA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是此语言域上的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>DFA recognition is the defining clause. Equivalence with NFA, epsilon-NFA, and regular-expression presentations is theorem content rather than circularly built into this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(M)$ (language accepted by a DFA, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(M))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Regular}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"38a6929b52694b0f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"},{"id":"23b25eb6ccba1a53","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数字母范围 $\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak L$ 见 [[73-df-families-of-languages]]。各固定字母表语言类见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"481adbebb0f51a94","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak L$ 与 $\\operatorname{Family}$ 见 [[73-df-families-of-languages]]；$\\operatorname{Hom},\\operatorname{Nonerasing}$ 和像/原像见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；正则类见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。下面各子式中重新量化的字母表与同态均为独立局部绑定。"},{"id":"95218b81d22ed54f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class|Regular Language]]"},{"id":"d98c56ef00c67ca3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2933d38e9d14eb7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$|\\Sigma|\\ge3$。所有语言类都取同一 $\\Sigma$；正则、CFL、CSL 的空词扩展、可判定与可识别类分别见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；CSL 的判定性见 [[73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound]]。"},{"id":"608143f8c61b3e57","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}$、$R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$K\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Delta}$，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)$。接口见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]、[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]、[[73-df-language-quotients]]、[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"},{"id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular language, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fa5a4ce6b6982a00","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular languages, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"},{"id":"7c30aa474cfc420f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7f8e16ecf4a3b9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；线性文法、生成语言、正则语言分别见 [[73-df-right-left-linear-grammars]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]、[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"},{"id":"705cd151c71b2488","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular languages, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])"},{"id":"92da433aceb4e9e5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)$。代换见 [[73-df-language-substitution]]，正则语言见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"},{"id":"2a79a31121d5fa2d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。